* set up FACTS solvation for energy claculation
*

if @?factsparam eq 0 set factsparam ! to nothing

set eps 1.
nbond nbxmod 5 atom cdie eps @eps shift vatom vdistance vswitch cutnb 14.0 ctofnb 12.0 ctonnb 10.0 e14fac wmin 1.5
scalar wmain = radius 
facts tcps 22 teps @eps gamm 0.015 tavw @factsparam

energy

